{"id":"22.10.MatchTile","contentHtml":"<p>This project is a technical research in which I recreated and polished the core mechanics of the mobile hit <code>Match Tile 3D</code> from scratch.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Goal:</strong> implement the mechanic in accordance with my <strong>own principles of ideal \"Player Feel\"</strong> — with maximum responsiveness and without artificial pauses.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>The key task was not just to copy the logic, but to <strong>achieve reference quality of execution</strong>, designing an architecture where player input has absolute priority, and gameplay is never interrupted by waiting.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Engineering Solution</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Non-blocking Architecture:</strong> A system is implemented where the player can <mark>continuously select items</mark>, even during slot clearing animation. Player actions and animations are processed asynchronously.</li>\n<li><strong>Adaptive Animations:</strong> The clearing animation speed automatically increases if the player selects an item while slots are already full, speeding up the pace.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Reference \"Player Feel\":</strong> The asynchronous system ensured perfectly smooth and continuous gameplay, meeting the best genre standards.</li>\n<li><strong>Skills Demonstration:</strong> The project proved my ability to <mark>intuitively find and implement the best UX solutions at the code level</mark> and create polished, production-ready mechanics.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Match Tile","date":"2022-10","type":"project","tagsArray":["Demo","Mobile","Unity","C#","VFX","Photoshop"],"heroVideo":["Ecid4sZT4zA"],"shortDescription":"<p>Tech demo: Recreated the Match Tile 3D mechanic by intuitively implementing a <mark>fully non-blocking architecture</mark> that meets the highest genre standards.</p>\n","storeLinks":null,"role":"solo","projectIcon":"/images/projects/22.10.MatchTile/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/22.10.MatchTile/card.mp4?v=1765046965705","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/22.10.MatchTile/screenshots/1.webp","width":526,"height":936},{"src":"/images/projects/22.10.MatchTile/screenshots/2.webp","width":526,"height":936},{"src":"/images/projects/22.10.MatchTile/screenshots/3.webp","width":526,"height":936}]}